================================================================================
Third-party Rust and npm dependencies
================================================================================

Lantunnel links against third-party crates and npm packages that are fetched at
build time and are not vendored here. Their licenses are enforced by the
allowlist in deny.toml and can be regenerated with:

    cargo deny check licenses
    cargo tree --format '{p} {l}'
